 data-orig-size=\"515,409\" data-comments-opened=\"0\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"2-13-3\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/2-13-3.png?fit=515%2C409&amp;ssl=1\" data-id=\"764\" src=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/2-13-3.png?resize=515%2C409&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-764\" srcset=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/2-13-3.png?w=515&amp;ssl=1 515w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/2-13-3.png?resize=300%2C238&amp;ssl=1 300w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 515px) 100vw, 515px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"515\" height=\"409\" data-attachment-id=\"765\" data-permalink=\"https:\/\/shaoyiwang.com\/?attachment_id=765\" data-orig-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/2-13-4.png?fit=515%2C409&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"515,409\" data-comments-opened=\"0\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"2-13-4\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/2-13-4.png?fit=515%2C409&amp;ssl=1\" data-id=\"765\" src=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/2-13-4.png?resize=515%2C409&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-765\" srcset=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/2-13-4.png?w=515&amp;ssl=1 515w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/2-13-4.png?resize=300%2C238&amp;ssl=1 300w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 515px) 100vw, 515px\" \/><\/figure>\n<\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center wp-block-paragraph\">.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center wp-block-paragraph\">.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Part 2.3: Gaussian and Laplacian Stacks<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">To implement Gaussian and Laplacian stacks, I first wrote a function to build the Gaussian stack. The stack starts with the original grayscale image. For each higher level i, I applied a Gaussian filter with increasing standard deviation and filter size:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">$$<br>\\sigma = 2i, n = 6\\sigma + 1<br>$$<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">This way, all levels in the stack have the same image dimensions, and the results can be stored in a single 3D matrix.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The Laplacian stack was then obtained by subtracting consecutive levels of the Gaussian stack. For each level i, the Laplacian image is defined as the difference between the Gaussian at level i and level i+1. The final level of the Laplacian stack stores the lowest frequency image, i.e., the last Gaussian image.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The Laplacian stack can be expressed as:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">$$<br>L_i = G_i &#8211; G_{i+1}, \\quad i = 0, 1, \\dots, N-2,  \\quad L_{N-1} = G_{N-1}<br>$$<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Below are the results of running the Laplacian stacks on the apple and orange images with level of 4:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-1 is-cropped wp-block-gallery-13 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"200\" data-attachment-id=\"775\" data-permalink=\"https:\/\/shaoyiwang.com\/?attachment_id=775\" data-orig-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/2-14.png?fit=1570%2C307&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"1570,307\" data-comments-opened=\"0\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"2-14\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/2-14.png?fit=1024%2C200&amp;ssl=1\" data-id=\"775\" src=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/2-14.png?resize=1024%2C200&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-775\" srcset=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/2-14.png?resize=1024%2C200&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/2-14.png?resize=300%2C59&amp;ssl=1 300w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/2-14.png?resize=768%2C150&amp;ssl=1 768w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/2-14.png?resize=1536%2C300&amp;ssl=1 1536w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/2-14.png?resize=1200%2C235&amp;ssl=1 1200w, https:\/\